descriptions.job-1vnvq4x:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Startups team is focused on one of Stripe’s most strategic growth areas: enabling the monetization and scaling of AI-native and AI-enabled businesses. We are in a unique position to partner with the most ambitious AI companies at the forefront of artificial intelligence. Our team collaborates across infrastructure, foundational models, agents, and applications to support these companies in their growth and global commercialization using Stripe’s comprehensive financial stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own contract renewals and lead commercial negotiations to increase revenue and market share among existing customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement sales cycle strategies to drive product adoption, new sales, and client retention at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address complex client needs by collaborating with product, sales, risk, and operations teams to enhance our offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine the go-to-market playbook for AI monetization and usage-based billing (UBB), including segmentation, messaging, sales strategy, and pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with AI founders and industry influencers to position Stripe as the preferred infrastructure for monetizing AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Stripe in market-facing activities (e.g., hackathons, webinars, events) to elevate our presence in the AI and billing ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a well-rounded strategic seller who can build strong relationships with Stripe’s clients and manage high velocity deal cycles. If you’re hungry, smart, persistent, and a great teammate, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a client-facing/sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex technical ecosystems and build great relationships with technical customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive and close upsell opportunities for additional Stripe products in long-term, consultative engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical ability to manage complex pricing and cost considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing projects with input from cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A knack for working well with a wide range of stakeholders, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and motivation to operate in a highly ambiguous and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a sales and/or customer-facing role at a high growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Excel and SQL, or a willingness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-10b834h:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world&#39;s biggest financial problems. We&#39;re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it&#39;s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We&#39;re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Developer Infrastructure &lt;/strong&gt;org is the engine behind Robinhood&#39;s entire engineering organization — a collection of tightly integrated teams whose collective mission is to make every engineer at Robinhood faster, more reliable, and exponentially more productive. The org spans four major teams: DevX (Developer Experience), TestX (Test Infrastructure), Backend Platform, and Mobile Platform. DevX owns Robinhood&#39;s monorepo and Bazel-based build infrastructure — the critical layer between a developer writing code and that code being ready to ship — along with the company&#39;s full CI/CD pipeline and remote build execution cluster. TestX owns the infrastructure behind Robinhood&#39;s entire test experience: the integration test environments, and personal development environments that serve as miniature simulations of the full Robinhood system, giving engineers a safe, isolated space to test their code end-to-end before it ever touches production. Backend Platform and Mobile Platform own the core language runtimes, libraries, IDEs, and developer toolchains across Python, Go, TypeScript, Swift, and Android. Together, these teams share a single north star: leveraging AI and agentic systems to fundamentally transform Robinhood&#39;s software development lifecycle — making every engineer dramatically more productive and the entire org a force multiplier for the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Senior Staff Software Engineer, Developer Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, you are the technical driver of this entire org — the Uber Tech Lead unifying DevX, TestX, Backend Platform, and Mobile Platform under one cohesive technical vision. Your primary focus will be DevX, owning the technical direction of Robinhood&#39;s most critical build and developer infrastructure. But your influence stretches far wider: you will be a driving force in weaving AI and agentic development deeply into every layer of the software development lifecycle — from intelligent code review and automated build pipelines to agentic coding systems that multiply what each engineer can ship. This is a rare opportunity to shape not just how Robinhood builds software today, but what engineering velocity looks like for the entire industry!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our &lt;strong&gt;New York City or Menlo Park&lt;/strong&gt; office, with in-person attendance expected at &lt;strong&gt;least 3&lt;/strong&gt; days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical direction and roadmap for the Developer Infrastructure org — serving as the Uber Tech Lead across DevX, TestX, Backend Platform, and Mobile Platform, unifying four engineering teams under a shared technical vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and evolve Robinhood&#39;s Bazel-based monorepo build infrastructure — own the remote build execution cluster, drive language-agnostic build optimization across Python, Go, TypeScript, and more, and ensure fast, stable feedback loops for the entire engineering org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale CI/CD pipelines to support thousands of daily builds with speed, safety, and reliability — overseeing GitHub repository configurations, pre-merge checks, and test execution infrastructure across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the vision for TestX — the test infrastructure and environments that power Robinhood&#39;s entire test experience, including integration test environments and personal development environments that simulate the full Robinhood system so engineers can test safely and confidently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the integration of AI and agentic systems across the full software development lifecycle — driving initiatives that use intelligent automation and coding agents to multiply developer velocity, improve code quality, and accelerate the pace of innovation across the org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical standards across Backend Platform and Mobile Platform — owning the vision for core language runtimes, libraries, IDE tooling, and developer environment security across Python, Go, TypeScript, Swift, and Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering leadership and cross-functional stakeholders to define and execute a long-term developer infrastructure roadmap that embeds AI as a force multiplier at every layer of the SDLC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience with a demonstrated track record at the Senior Staff, Principal, or Distinguished Engineer level — you&#39;ve set technical direction at the org or company level, not just the team level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise with Bazel and large-scale monorepo build systems — you&#39;ve owned remote build execution infrastructure at scale and understand the architectural tradeoffs deeply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating CI/CD pipelines at massive scale — across thousands of daily builds, multiple programming languages, and complex pre-merge pipeline logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Go and/or Python; broad familiarity with TypeScript, Swift, or Android development environments is a strong signal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background with distributed systems, Kubernetes, and cloud infrastructure (AWS preferred) — you understand the full stack of developer tooling from IDE to deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test infrastructure, integration test environments, or developer environment platforms — you understand what a great test experience looks like at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in or hands-on experience with agentic AI systems, automated code review, or AI-driven developer velocity programs — you have a clear point of view on how AI will reshape the software development lifecycle and want to be the one building it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional technical leadership, communication, and influence skills — you&#39;ve unified cross-functional engineering teams around a shared vision and driven ambiguous, org-spanning initiatives to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of mentoring senior engineers and elevating the technical bar across large, diverse engineering organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the Robinhood Employee Fund that gives eligible US employees the opportunity to invest in a private employee fund that provides exposure to Robinhood Ventures funds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$264,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$310,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$264,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$310,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$264,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$310,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1i7qnkh:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Work from anywhere, impact everywhere&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity is at the heart of who we are at Xapo Bank. &lt;br&gt;We’re a fully distributed team of over 160 Xapiens that work remotely from 50+ countries around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beginning: A world that enjoys economic freedom and wealth protection,no matter where you live or who is running your country.&lt;br&gt;To achieve that, we search the world for the best people for the job. &lt;br&gt;We work hard, think globally, and inspire each other to learn and grow. &lt;br&gt;We are committed to changing the way things are done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Although we are headquartered in Gibraltar, this is a full time, 100% remote position&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Work from anywhere!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Xapo Bank is establishing a Structured Solutions function to own and expand its product offering, spanning yield products, tokenisation, asset-backed lending (ABL) workstreams, and new structures at the intersection of digital assets and traditional finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Structured Solutions, you will take ownership of an established, revenue-generating credit fund and the counterparty relationships that sit behind it, while setting the strategic direction for what we build next. You will report directly to the CFO, own the house view on structured product strategy, act as the primary interface with our external licensed Investment Manager and the Investment Committee, and have the mandate and budget to grow the team as the function scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare combination: a live book with existing counterparties, an established governance process, and dedicated analyst support from day one, alongside genuine authority to shape what Xapo Bank&#39;s structured product offering becomes and to build the team you need to deliver it. You will have a structured transition period working alongside experienced outgoing team members to absorb institutional knowledge, models, data, and counterparty context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Credit judgement is central to this role, not a supporting activity. Counterparty selection, due diligence and ongoing monitoring are how the credit fund is managed day to day, so we need someone whose underwriting is as strong as their structuring, as credible assessing a counterparty as they are designing a payoff profile, with the judgement to walk away from a deal that prices well but underwrites badly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In your first 12 months you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of the fund and its counterparty relationships, completing the knowledge transfer from the outgoing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish your operating rhythm with the Investment Committee and the licensed Investment Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set out the forward roadmap for Xapo&#39;s structured product offering and the resourcing to deliver it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and product:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategic direction and house view for structured investment solutions, identifying and designing new structured products for the Xapo client base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead delivery of yield products, tokenisation initiatives, Bitcoin Backed Loans, and other new structures from concept through to launch, from payoff profile through to delivery mechanism, including regulatory consequences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for driving Xapo&#39;s internal investment committee, a monthly forum with the CEO, CFO, and Head of Product, on new ideas, products, and structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Credit, due diligence, and risk:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FUND&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own comprehensive initial due diligence on prospective counterparties and ongoing due diligence on existing ones, covering counterparty financial analysis, business processes, and risk evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce credit assessments in a standardised, committee-ready format suitable for review by the licensed Investment Manager and the Investment Committee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain ongoing credit risk oversight of the book, ensuring positions are managed appropriately and the fund operates within its mandate at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set, monitor, and enforce exposure, concentration, and limit frameworks, escalating breaches and emerging risks promptly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;XAPO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside the Risk function on price risk and credit risk evaluation, system requirements, and regulatory consequences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fund Origination, execution, and relationships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and originate new counterparties for the fund to lend to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present due diligence and lending proposals through the Investment Committee, owning the quality and rigour of the committee process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Legal in negotiating the fund&#39;s standard documentation with counterparties through to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and evolve counterparty relationships across the life of each facility, keeping engagement current across all commercial and operational matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fund operations and stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of engagement with the external licensed Investment Manager on regulated fund management activity, maintaining constant contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee fund operations and accounting, liaising with the fund administrator and fund accountant to ensure NAV is struck correctly and resolving operational issues as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Xapo Operations and the fund accountant on reconciliation, ensuring everything matches correctly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocate coin and capital inflows arising from investors sourced by Xapo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the fund internally, keeping the wider Xapo organisation informed on positioning, activity, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Treasury and banking input:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Treasury, providing advisory input across risk evaluation, trading and execution, and system requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute banking input on ALCO, stress testing, and pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team and knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, manage, and develop the Structured Solutions team, mentoring junior analysts and expanding the bench as the function grows — you will have the mandate to shape the team&#39;s size and shape over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the team: surface and resolve blockers quickly, run regular one-to-ones, and take ownership of team wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the team within Xapo, articulating what it needs and keeping the organisation informed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure institutional knowledge is documented and durable, contributing to and maintaining the investment team knowledge portal so that the function is not dependent on any single individual.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an internal reference point for technical, market, and crypto-ecosystem questions, contributing to projects across the business where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;During the initial transition period, work alongside outgoing senior team members to absorb institutional knowledge, models, data, and counterparty context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills needed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience in investment management, structured products, or digital asset markets, including senior ownership of a product, credit, or trading function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable credit underwriting and counterparty risk experience, ideally including unsecured lending, with the judgement to say no to a deal that prices well but underwrites badly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to diligence both sides of the market: regulated financial institutions using audited financials, capital position, and covenant analysis; and crypto-native counterparties, including the limitations of proof-of-reserves, custody and rehypothecation risk, venue and exchange exposure, on-chain analysis, and opaque cross-jurisdictional group structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative capability and comfort building or overseeing pricing, risk, and structuring models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing and launching new financial products, ideally spanning yield, lending, or tokenisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating through formal governance processes such as investment committees, with the judgement to know when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated people leadership: building teams, developing junior talent, and setting a clear technical and strategic direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with both Bitcoin and traditional fiat markets, and genuine interest in where digital assets and structured finance intersect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, comfortable engaging with external investment managers, counterparties, and internal committees alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to regulated fund structures and working alongside a licensed external investment manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with fund operations, including fund administrators, fund accountants, and the NAV process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships within digital asset counterparty or institutional investor networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience standing up or scaling a new team or function within a fintech, bank, or asset manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance sheet and treasury experience, including ALCO, stress testing, and pricing within a regulated credit institution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking over an existing book and making it your own, rather than only building from a blank page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dedicated workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reliable internet connection with the fastest speed possible in your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment with Our Values and the Xapo Values-Driven Leadership principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Why work for Xapo?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Impact Globally, Work Remotely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Future&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improve lives through cutting-edge technology, work 100% remotely from anywhere in the world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great work-life balance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Build amazing things with a balance of autonomy and collaborative teamwork. Set your own work schedule and make use of a flexible PTO plan when you need to recharge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expect Excellence&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Collaborate, learn, and grow with a high-performance team. Learn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt; how you learn best - from books to conferences, you’ll get a yearly budget for your individual learning and development goals.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Xapo, we prioritize consumer protection and adhere to regulatory requirements by ensuring that all Xapiens are accountable for upholding principles of fair treatment, transparency, and ethical conduct in their interactions with customers and stakeholders.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0otxa1d:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;NA6ldbQPYojTIvx3eXKufZUts2d&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WXbxduQCCoXyStxBZqhuWbYHsdd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WXbxduQCCoXyStxBZqhuWbYHsdd&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;MLRO / Principal Officer&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the AML/CFT and financial crime compliance framework for a digital asset payments business operating in India.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WoWHdW6NVoClYFxlsSGuI64bstd&quot;&gt;The role will serve as the designated Principal Officer under applicable Indian AML requirements, with responsibility for regulatory reporting, AML governance and engagement with FIU-IND.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-YRF4dFLIsojhDkx15zluwVBesrb&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QACSdNJphoM28xxIgpduNGkXsj3&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the designated Principal Officer / MLRO, overseeing compliance with the PMLA, PML Rules and applicable FIU-IND requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3yHdm5eco6fcGxb4HIu1T6ps6d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own and maintain the AML/CFT/CPF framework, including policies, risk assessments, transaction monitoring and supporting controls.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XkW2dp7CJoyv6ExzSKxuUdbisAc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee regulatory reporting to FIU-IND, including STR, CTR and other applicable filings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O5KAdjwSUoNAMhxwRBlujzWgsDb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee KYC/KYB, CDD/EDD, sanctions screening and customer risk frameworks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CHSLdMnpyo9fSqxQ6BxuKLTEs1e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee financial crime controls relating to fiat and virtual digital asset flows, including blockchain analytics and Travel Rule requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NBkndgAvjo7Vx1x4E3uu87sGsWv&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Serve as the primary AML/CFT contact for FIU-IND and relevant authorities, including regulatory inspections and enquiries.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FtKwdQG6wohYKlxpfFKukCugsWg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide AML reporting to senior management and relevant governance bodies, and coordinate audits, reviews and remediation activities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MltNd1WwCoW0jExQPNguNtDtsre&quot;&gt;Mandatory Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MLVidAA8RoQRNDxmZ6kuwsgssQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8–10 years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including significant experience in AML/CFT, financial crime or regulatory compliance in India.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TUhZd33ryovSQxxFuhGuXgcPstb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong working knowledge of PMLA, PML Rules and FIU-IND requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KT5YdQSAsoQy8UxKXjhuwvRTs5i&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with FIU-IND reporting and FINnet, including STR/CTR filings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MLttd3ywDo1hkXxOh6Uuve5MsFe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Meet all applicable fit and proper requirements for appointment as Principal Officer / MLRO, including appropriate integrity, competence, experience and regulatory standing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZlFzdUyaKoicEOxTZ2fukeX1sdc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Qualify as an officer at management level for the purposes of appointment as Principal Officer under applicable PML Rules.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q5QMd2qlCo28oZxQpzBu6zGpsrg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Based in India and able to engage directly with FIU-IND and other relevant authorities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-J5b7d0Hx4o8L3LxNL7fufDG6sre&quot;&gt;Preferred&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TFFCdHmGvoJHsPx0YQzuEFoLsEc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior experience as a Principal Officer, MLRO, Compliance Officer or equivalent regulated role.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FuBed4q0OopWFdxYGoquLX4Wsfd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience within payments, fintech, banking or digital assets, with VDA/crypto experience strongly preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FD5bdW6vGoNMLjxXwwhubCk1sib&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with blockchain analytics, sanctions, KYC/CDD and transaction monitoring.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MnhPdEKLdo1sFSxhoLjubxcFsdh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Relevant AML certification such as CAMS.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-07ndq35:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the team + role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world&#39;s biggest financial problems. We&#39;re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it&#39;s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We&#39;re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for talented and motivated iOS Developers to join our Apple Design Award winning team to help expand Robinhood&#39;s mobile experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Developer Intern, iOS, you&#39;ll build smooth, stable, and beautiful products used by millions of people every day. You&#39;ll own features end-to-end — from inception through design feedback, implementation, and launch — working directly with experienced developers on one of the most recognized mobile teams in fintech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Toronto, ON office with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build smooth, stable, and beautiful products using Swift and the latest iOS and watchOS APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features from inception, through design feedback, implementation, and launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Designers, Product Managers, Backend Developers, and Data Developers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with technologies such as UIKit, Auto Layout, RxSwift, Core Graphics, Core Animation, Lottie, Core Data, and a VIPER-esque Architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a full-time, degree-seeking program with an expected graduation date of Winter 2027 or Spring 2028&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and experience working closely with Product Designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of UIKit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and a passion for tackling tough technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market competitive compensation structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly lifestyle wallet for personal wellness, learning and development, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time away including company holidays, paid time off, and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lively office environment with catered meals, fully stocked kitchens, and geo-specific commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is committed to providing an inclusive and welcoming interview experience for all candidates. If you require a specific accommodation during the application or interview process due to a physical or mental condition, please complete this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://robinhood.hracuity.net/webform/index/752875e4-42ba-4dff-9951-fd51e315997e&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Applicant Accommodation Form&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to notify our team. The form should only be completed if you need a specific accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Usage Disclosure:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Robinhood uses artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of our recruiting process. These tools enhance the efficiency and consistency of our hiring process; however, all hiring decisions are made by our hiring teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacancy Notice:&lt;/strong&gt; This job posting represents an existing vacancy that we are actively seeking to fill.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected hourly range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$40&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$40 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0a42n2p:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Total Rewards Strategy &amp;amp; Enablement (TR S&amp;amp;E) team translates people strategy into business impact, building the infrastructure, programs, and systems that make Total Rewards work at scale. We bridge strategy and execution, partnering with People leadership and cross-functional teams across Finance, Legal, and the business to turn ambiguous problems into durable programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a collaborative, action-oriented Project Manager to join the Total Rewards Strategy and Enablement team. In this role, you’ll lead business-critical People projects, with a primary focus on mergers and acquisitions (M&amp;amp;A).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bringing an acquired business into Stripe requires coordinated work across Total Rewards, People Partners, Recruiting, People Operations, Legal, Finance, and Corporate Development. You’ll project manage the People workstream from diligence and integration planning through close and post-close execution. You’ll turn deal-specific decisions into clear plans, ownership, milestones, and risk-management approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll coordinate functional owners across People workstreams, establish plans and dependencies, and step into the work when needed to unblock progress or close critical gaps. Your work will support transaction timelines, reduce business disruption, and create a consistent experience for acquired Stripes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll build People M&amp;amp;A’s capabilities through repeatable playbooks, infrastructure, and cross-training. This individual contributor role is well suited to someone who can bring structure to ambiguity and move between strategy and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project manage People M&amp;amp;A workstreams &lt;/strong&gt;from diligence and planning through close and post-close execution. Workstreams may include organizational alignment, employee data, onboarding, recruiting, and people program integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a central coordination point &lt;/strong&gt;across Total Rewards, People Partners, People Operations, People Systems, Recruiting, People Support, Corporate Development, Legal, Finance, and Corporate Technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align plans, dependencies, decisions, and accountability &lt;/strong&gt;with transaction timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and run integration and change-management plans &lt;/strong&gt;that give functional leads, acquired Stripes, and other affected audiences the information and support they need at each stage of a transaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify cross-functional dependencies, risks, and blockers early. &lt;/strong&gt;Coordinate resolution and escalate issues when needed to protect integration timelines and the Stripe experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish feedback and support mechanisms for acquired Stripes&lt;/strong&gt;, including surveys, office hours, and centralized support channels. Use feedback to improve integration plans and change-management approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and improve People M&amp;amp;A’s infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, including project plans, templates, checklists, playbooks, reporting, and retrospective documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build capability across People workstreams &lt;/strong&gt;through documentation, cross-training, and shared practices that support more consistent future integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support other business-critical and transformational projects &lt;/strong&gt;across Total Rewards and the People team as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years of project or program management experience at a global company, including 2+ years project managing workstreams within the M&amp;amp;A lifecycle, including diligence, integration planning, close readiness, and post-close integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience leading complex, cross-functional programs from planning through execution and building repeatable program infrastructure, such as integration playbooks, project-plan templates, readiness checklists, risk logs, or retrospective processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of turning ambiguous problems into structured, repeatable programs. You’re comfortable building new programs in a scaling environment while improving and standardizing how work gets done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent written and verbal communication skills. You can write a one-page executive update, a decision memo tailored to stakeholders, and a step-by-step operator playbook with equal fluency. You guide project teams through complex work in a direct, approachable, and inclusive way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can manage senior cross-functional stakeholders across Total Rewards, People Partners, People Systems, Recruiting, Corporate Development, Legal, and Finance. You know when to build alignment, raise a risk, and escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working with data and systems such as Workday and Greenhouse. You use data to clarify decisions, communicate recommendations, and define requirements with People Systems partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You focus on the experience of acquired Stripes and the teams operating the program, not only on program artifacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can manage competing priorities and adapt in a fast-paced environment. You work effectively independently and across teams, bring structure to complexity, and follow through on the details that make a program successful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with change management frameworks, such as the Prosci ADKAR Model, and applying them to employee or operational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project or program management certification or training, such as Project Management Professional (PMP), Lean, Six Sigma, or a comparable methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1unfqj5:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe, LLC. is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team strategy, roadmap, tooling, process, and culture. Scope, design, implement, and deploy robust solutions, making appropriate tradeoffs between reliability, throughput, latency, resiliency, engineering velocity and cost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate, design and implement software solutions that contribute towards improvement in infrastructure resiliency, reliability, efficiency and management at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold our high engineering standards and improve our codebase and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must have a Bachelor&#39;s degree or foreign equivalent in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or a related field, plus 5 years of progressive, post-baccalaureate experience in Software development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must also have 5 years of experience in each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing, maintaining and debugging distributed systems built with open source tools;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building infrastructure as a product centered around users’ needs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling distributed systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Breaking down large complex systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying shortcomings and optimization opportunities to make data driven cost performance tradeoffs to influence design decisions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and operating infrastructure and tools that empower developers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a development team in AWS, Azure, OCI or GCP; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming languages: Ruby, Go, Python, or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $206,086.00&amp;nbsp;- $285,600.00/yr&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary range represents the base salary range for the role and any sales commissions/sales bonuses targets, if applicable, would be in addition to the base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;40 hrs/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;50 % Telecommuting Permitted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple Positions Available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits for this role may include: equity, company bonus or sales commissions/bonuses; 401(k) plan; medical, dental, and vision benefits; and wellness stipends. &lt;strong&gt;WA56&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

descriptions.job-1in0v9t:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role - (12-month contract)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Designer to design and build internal tools for complex financial operations. This is a hands-on role for someone who can move fluidly between user research, systems design, AI prototyping, and production code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with product, engineering, and operations to turn complicated workflows, business rules, and technical constraints into intuitive, reliable tools. You should be comfortable working independently—from identifying the problem through shipping and iterating on a production solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the end-to-end design process:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead projects from research and workflow discovery through prototyping, validation, detailed design, implementation, and post-launch iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design complex operational workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Build tools involving multiple user roles, data sources, business rules, approvals, exceptions, and audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build AI-powered prototypes:&lt;/strong&gt; Rapidly create functional prototypes for alignment across multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn prototypes into production experiences:&lt;/strong&gt; Write and contribute code within production environments, working through code review, testing, deployment, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion operational users:&lt;/strong&gt; Understand the needs and constraints of financial operations teams through interviews, observation, workflow analysis, and usability testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply systems-level thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Design data-rich interfaces that help users monitor activity, investigate issues, manage exceptions, and make informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Work comfortably within engineering processes, helping push production code into the front end.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to the design system:&lt;/strong&gt; Create scalable patterns for tables, forms, dashboards, alerts, approvals, audit histories, and AI-assisted interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute independently:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage multiple initiatives while clearly communicating progress, risks, dependencies, and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;6+ years of experience in product design &lt;/strong&gt;in startup or other fast paced environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have designed and launched in complex or technical industries, such as financial services, pharmaceuticals, healthcare, infrastructure, logistics, manufacturing, aerospace, or automotive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable reading and building with API documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can translate complicated processes, data, business rules, and edge cases into clear and efficient experiences, keeping auditability and regulatory concerns in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work independently, create structure in ambiguous environments, and move projects forward without extensive oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate design decisions clearly across product, engineering, operations, and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://files.alpaca.markets/disclosures/AlpacaRecruitmentPrivacyPolicy.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0hqytg1:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Figure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figure Technology Solutions, Inc. (Nasdaq: FIGR; OPEN: FGRS) is the leading blockchain-native capital marketplace for the origination, funding, sale and trading of tokenized assets. More than 480 partners use its loan origination system and capital marketplace. Collectively, Figure and its partners have originated over $30 billion of loans to date, among other products. The fastest growing components are Figure Connect, its credit marketplace, and Democratized Prime, Figure’s on-chain lend-borrow marketplace. Figure’s ecosystem also includes DART (Digital Asset Registry Technology) for asset custody and lien perfection, and $YLDS, a yield-bearing stablecoin registered with the SEC as a security under the Securities Act of 1933.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Figure is the market leader in real-world asset (RWA) tokenization. The company has received triple-A ratings from S&amp;amp;P and Moody’s on multiple loan securitizations, the first of its kind for blockchain finance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re proud to be recognized as one of &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/lists/fintech50/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Top 50 Fintech Companies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnbc.com/worlds-top-fintech-companies-2026/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CNBC’s World’s Top Fintech Companies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team as a Credit Risk Manager! In this collaborative, high-visibility role, you will harness cutting-edge analytics and alternative data to transform customer insights into winning strategies for our HELOC and secured lending portfolios. Partnering closely with Capital Markets, Product, Engineering, Servicing, and Compliance, you will oversee credit policies, guide execution, and pioneer creative risk frameworks that safeguard portfolio health while unlocking growth. If you are a proactive problem solver who loves digging deep into lending analytics, exploring novel data sources, and uniting cross-functional teams around portfolio performance, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine and modernize credit underwriting strategies using advanced analytics to optimize risk decisions across lending products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze historical loan performance data to model credit expansion initiatives, identify new customer segments, and optimize funnel conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform root-cause analyses on credit losses and default trends, partnering with Fraud Risk Management to sharpen fraud controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop valuation models to estimate segment-level economics and advise Capital Markets on yield projections and performance assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, and Data Science to design A/B tests that balance risk control, conversion lift, and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and validate pre- and post-implementation performance for all deployed credit and fraud rule changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design monitoring frameworks to track new product launches at a granular segment level, identify emerging portfolio risks, and inform executive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present Figure’s underwriting methodology to investors and serve as a core contact for due diligence and portfolio performance inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Legal and Compliance to ensure all credit strategies strictly meet regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct ad hoc quantitative analyses to support broader Credit, Operations, and Product objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor/Master’s degree with a quantitative background (e.g., Statistics, Math, Economics, Computer Science, Engineering, or Business).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in credit risk management or data science within consumer lending.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-moving, evolving environment where priorities shift, and initiatives move quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, with intense focus on results. High curiosity with a proven track record of probing root causes, challenging the status quo, and designing out-of-the-box solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, combined with solid business judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, strong communicator who can translate complex data into simple, actionable insights for any audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team player and comfortable interacting with partners across multiple teams and at varying levels of seniority&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and Python/R for pulling, cleaning, and modeling complex relational data independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical application of predictive modeling, customer segmentation, and statistical procedures to evaluate risk and borrower behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Tableau, Power BI, and Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to all company security policies and data handling procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete mandatory security awareness training within required timeframes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promptly report any suspected security incidents or suspicious activity to the Security team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Base Compensation Range: $134,640 - $168,300/yr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;25% annual bonus target, paid quarterly&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Company equity in the form of RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the compensation range for the role in the United States. Actual compensation may vary based on a candidate’s experience, skills, location, internal equity, and evolving business needs. While most offers are generally made within the middle of the range, final compensation is determined based on the factors above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision coverage, with 100% employer-paid premiums for employees and their dependents on select plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Company HSA, FSA, Dependent Care FSA, 401(k), and commuter benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Employer-paid life and disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;11 observed holidays and PTO plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Up to 12 weeks of paid family leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Continuing education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your residential location certain laws might regulate the way Figure manages applicant data. California Residents, please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figure.com/ca-employee-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;California Employee&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figure.com/workforce-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;General Workforce Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for further information.&amp;nbsp;By submitting your application, you are agreeing and&amp;nbsp;acknowledging&amp;nbsp;that you have read and understand the above notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figure will not sponsor work visas for this position. In compliance with federal law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the United States and to complete the required employment eligibility verification form upon hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RF1 #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0twack1:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Tokenization &lt;/strong&gt;team&#39;s mission is to bring both public and private equity to be tradable 24/7 on decentralized exchanges (DEXs) across the Robinhood Chain. We work at the intersection of blockchain technology, financial market infrastructure, and modern distributed systems - with a focus on accessibility, security, and scalability. Equity markets have been closed nights and weekends for a century; we&#39;re building the infrastructure that changes that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll build and own backend services that make tokenized equities work end to end - issuance, custody, and settlement on-chain, kept in sync with traditional brokerage and ledger systems. You&#39;ll ship product-facing features and platform capabilities in a domain where correctness is non-negotiable - the systems you build move real customer assets, continuously, around the clock.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role are based in either our &lt;strong&gt;Menlo Park, Toronto or New York city &lt;/strong&gt;offices, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, and deploy the backend services that mint, custody, and settle tokenized equities on the Robinhood Chain, with correctness and auditability as hard requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop product-facing features and platform enhancements that meet strict correctness and scalability standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the connective tissue between traditional market infrastructure (brokerage, ledgers, corporate actions) and on-chain systems, including smart contract integrations, chain indexers, and DEX trade flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement improvements to system performance, engineering productivity, and risk reduction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product, compliance, client, and platform teams to deliver impactful technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in backend development using languages such as Go, Python, or Java, with a solid grasp of cloud-native architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of system design, data modeling, and software engineering fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care for correctness-critical systems - idempotency, reconciliation, and reasoning carefully about failure modes when money is at stake&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mindset, with a track record of delivering high-quality projects end to end in cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in blockchain fundamentals - EVM, smart contracts, wallets, on-chain settlement - or a strong appetite to go deep quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4419&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4437&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4488&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4613&quot;&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4735&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4849&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4946&quot;&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5037&quot;&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5139&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$166,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$147,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$172,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$152,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0ayny8h:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;This is a 12-week internship during summer 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a Sales, Trading, and Prime (STP) Intern, you&#39;ll join the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Institutional&lt;/a&gt; team and rotate through Sales, Account Management, Execution Services, Financing, Solutions Architecture, and Research. This team engages with the world&#39;s most sophisticated institutions to introduce new products, provide market color, devise financing solutions, and deliver client feedback that informs product development. You&#39;ll come away with a unique understanding of our clients&#39; needs and how Coinbase builds relationships and trust through outstanding service and product capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rotate across 2 STP functions such as Sales, Account Management, Execution Services, Financing, Solutions Architecture, and Research to build a comprehensive view of institutional client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data for trends and opportunities, producing competitor analysis and market commentary that inform client engagement strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create pitchbooks and outreach materials for client presentations and high-value prospect engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and follow up with inbound leads to qualify sales opportunities, tracking progress across product campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and propose process improvements that grow and strengthen the STP business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently in your junior year of an undergraduate program (rising senior in summer 2027) with demonstrated academic achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the crypto/blockchain industry and familiarity with financial markets, with the ability to contextualize market trends for institutional audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with crypto ecosystems (e.g., self-custody, DeFi, staking, trading) through personal use, coursework, or projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a sales or business development role (e.g., internship, campus organization, or entrepreneurial venture) with a track record of proactively generating leads and building relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to produce clear, structured written deliverables such as research summaries, presentations, or market analysis through coursework, projects, or prior internships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
