&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GX6qd72HIoARPKxHbS1ltgjVgJf&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tt5qdGgb8oHpsgxAlcXlWZyygse&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
