&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3bYvV5DS6icDHnquWbEcNb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3bYvV5DS6icDHnquWbEcNb&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusNg8YunaXqsmUGGOjLzfpmh&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;RpoEdRXrWoavx2xJ5CPu6mmysBc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKOAdw3kVoh5EQxcr2juP3i0sTb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TunGdNQsToLGO1xV5ZClhky5gxc&quot;&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I7iWd8wxMoZVZ8xSCHVlGHdGgSd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;WjJkdZMZ4oF0ncxMIeDl6liBg7b&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgpbcQvcMpVkJ8prUBGnB5sd&quot;&gt;OKX is building local exchange businesses from the ground up across multiple emerging and high-growth markets. We are looking for a product leader who has driven a complete 0-to-1 cycle in a priority overseas market — someone who will own the product strategy and local growth playbook for a specific region or country, and be directly accountable for product competitiveness and business growth outcomes in that market.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgiRaRnZ7T6a8UnBAgFZI7rf&quot;&gt;This role sits at the intersection of the Local business team and Global product and engineering. You&#39;ll go deep into the local market — translating user profiles, regulatory landscapes, and competitive dynamics into product and growth strategies — while driving Global product and engineering resources to deliver locally, ensuring the product experience and competitiveness actually take off on the ground.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgUpgNlg77LGZCJfhft04zbe&quot;&gt;We are not prescriptive about which specific region you&#39;ve built in previously — LatAm, Southeast Asia, Turkey, MENA, or others are all relevant. What matters is that you have personally built a business in an emerging market, closed the growth loop, and can transfer that methodology to OKX&#39;s priority regions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg5snITk8sEX69VTTy70TXmc&quot;&gt;This is a product leadership role, not a country general manager role — but you need to operate with near business-owner accountability: responsible for the region&#39;s core growth metrics and product competitiveness, not just shipping features.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KiGldFOoPomfd6x3n53llaMtgSc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KiGldFOoPomfd6x3n53llaMtgSc&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusC0ScijlHsAbE8dYk7NUSrd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KiGldFOoPomfd6x3n53llaMtgSc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;WjJkdZMZ4oF0ncxMIeDl6liBg7b&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgcmVybmX3frDtYbDqUplP2e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Product Strategy &amp;amp; Local Growth Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgGinuQGBNtMzJTdUmyiLHbd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own product strategy and local growth planning for a specific region or country, working across the Local business team and Global product and engineering to be directly accountable for local product competitiveness and business growth outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg4mkMWcJo0G3oYc5R6c61pm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop a deep understanding of local user profiles, legal and regulatory frameworks, competitive landscapes, and cultural nuances, and translate these into a comprehensive product competition strategy and channel growth strategy with clear prioritization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgjKZ4n5z8HoFEzeoiYG4zWg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Continuously track the local crypto and fintech ecosystem — with a focus on global players and regional leaders across exchanges and fintech — as well as macro factors such as inflation, currency depreciation, and cross-border remittance demand that shape user trading behavior.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgFyMMEFZdR4WQeaM8WQAHPf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local Product Experience &amp;amp; Competitiveness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgRAp6movo5eosMlNZ9dCQjh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the end-to-end local product experience and competitiveness, covering onboarding, fiat deposit, market analysis, trading, and earn — the core stages of the user journey.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgOlPDCuwQRaTXSDh3JkYWxh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build a comprehensive local product feedback loop — from user behavior data and funnel analysis, to local user feedback collection — to identify key bottlenecks and high-leverage opportunities in conversion, retention, and engagement, and drive iterative improvement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgZ9zIU6hjC8okrbrmnuYo5m&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Adapt to local market characteristics (inflation-driven demand, competitor switching costs, payment method preferences, etc.) to reduce drop-off from registration to first trade and shorten time-to-first-trade.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg9Zq39aLL2AzHdxBmVUioDh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel Growth &amp;amp; Cross-team Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgp6dJeqg9DEQxjABqWeV11e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work with local teams to identify effective user acquisition channels; lead the discovery, introduction, integration, and scaling of high-impact channels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgjy5xoEbCe01ib7MKW9ZmGh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Leverage your local network — KOLs, fintech partners, payment providers, regulatory contacts — to accelerate market entry and growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgYEBJFXRrrVJmhVNB2OSFPc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate closely with regional BD, Marketing, Operations, and Global product and engineering to ensure product initiatives align with local growth objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NRBbdOSM8oBGpNxa71PlFitDgHc&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusJHbXag5ngXLLiXggj1zhBg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;WjJkdZMZ4oF0ncxMIeDl6liBg7b&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgQ4APWBH9JD7tzln1BxScxe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0-to-1 business building and growth experience in an emerging market&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., LatAm, Southeast Asia, Turkey, MENA, or similar) — you can clearly articulate the regional metrics you owned and the business outcomes you delivered. You held a product, strategy, or growth role during the early stage of an international expansion at a tech company or at a high-growth local champion in the region.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgVTYBw0Ntui7nMqtgE1kMEd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive business growth and user growth methodology&lt;/strong&gt; — you have fully owned a user funnel (acquisition → activation → retention) and can speak to results with data: CAC, activation rates, D7/D30 retention, LTV, reactivation. Your work was growth experimentation and product intervention, not just media buying.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgHGDesdaw5dWrdPauAn5ofb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product management capability&lt;/strong&gt; — you can define product strategy and success metrics, prioritize a roadmap, drive A/B testing, and collaborate with product and engineering to deliver. This is a product leadership role, not a GM or pure growth marketing role.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlghCES4E26ygiF7MzKz8vb9m&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — able to drive alignment across teams (design, engineering, data, commercial), manage external partnerships, and navigate regulatory conversations. Effective at aligning resources between Local and Global organizations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg8ux6v2r6sa9FHilaup6GEh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep local market knowledge and an established local network&lt;/strong&gt; — you understand local user behaviors, payment ecosystems (e.g., PIX, SPEI, Mercado Pago, UPI, GCash, DANA, M-Pesa, depending on region), regulatory environments, and competitive dynamics. You have partners, KOLs, and industry relationships in the region that you can activate.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgfF0BwsWgSe1uUMaTJpFEqc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer product management experience&lt;/strong&gt; in fintech, crypto, or trading preferred. Candidates with experience managing or mentoring product teams will be considered for the Senior Product Director level.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgvES4qQXEGesjmOcPn6yagh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in Mandarin is a strong plus for effective collaboration with HQ teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kf0adcga6ojnmfxQWZVl1gF3gxf&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusKUjfoqh7QZ5RVAXhjX7gig&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
